From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 15:53:53 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] adapt-to-1-9-0

Brings the series onto slot v1.9.0: upstream's Screenshot takes SELECT+X, so Picture Next defaults to SELECT+Y (the colour entry steps aside on the systems that flip the picture, and the two rows never clash), the classic shelf order follows upstream's Game Boy Color before Game Boy, the array lengths follow the new rows, and the controls and picture tests follow. ADR 0109.
